Usage: gccli events add --name=STRING --date=DATE --type=STRING [flags]

Add a calendar event.

Flags:
  -h, --help                 Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json                 Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain                Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
      --header               Print the column names as the first line of --plain
                             output ($GCCLI_HEADER).
      --color="auto"         Color mode: auto, always, never ($GCCLI_COLOR).
      --account=STRING       Garmin account email ($GCCLI_ACCOUNT).
      --units="auto"         Unit system for distances, speeds, paces,
                             elevations and weights in table and plain output:
                             auto (Garmin profile), metric, statute_us,
                             statute_uk ($GCCLI_UNITS).
      --version              Print version information.

  -n, --name=STRING          Event name.
  -d, --date=DATE            Event date (YYYY-MM-DD, today, +30d).
  -t, --type=STRING          Event type.
      --race                 Mark as a race.
      --location=STRING      Event location.
      --time=HH:MM           Start time (HH:MM).
      --timezone=STRING      Time zone ID (e.g. Europe/Berlin).
      --distance=DISTANCE    Target distance (e.g. 10km, 26.2mi, 400m).
      --goal=GOAL            Time goal duration (e.g. 50m, 1h30m, 2400s).
      --primary              Set as primary training event.
      --training             Set as supporting training event.
      --private              Make event private.
      --note=STRING          Event note.
      --url=STRING           Event URL.

